/*
 * Smart Office - STM32F103C6T6
 * RFID/keypad entry, IR exit on PA1, 20 events, optional Wi-Fi.
 *
 * LCD/I2C revision:
 * - Wait for STOP and bus idle after transfers.
 * - Do not reset the shared bus merely because a device NACKs.
 * - Bounded bus recovery and STM32F1 filter-unlock sequence.
 * - Restart LCD initialization after bus recovery.
 *
 * Keep existing Cube HAL, startup and interrupt files.
 * USART1 and DMA1 Channel 5 IRQs are disabled; RX uses circular DMA.
 * EXTI15_10_IRQHandler calls HAL_GPIO_EXTI_IRQHandler(GPIO_PIN_10).
 * SysTick_Handler calls HAL_IncTick().
 *
 * Build with -Os, 32 KB FLASH, 10 KB RAM.
 */

